1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,915
Stadionimiz tayyor! Lekin bitta muammo bor…

2
00:00:03,985 --> 00:00:05,958
Tribunalarimiz hali ham bo‘sh!

3
00:00:06,188 --> 00:00:09,040
Zamin FK yangi o‘yinga tayyorlanmoqda!

4
00:00:09,110 --> 00:00:11,678
Bizni Star Boys bilan uchrashuv kutmoqda!

5
00:00:11,908 --> 00:00:13,667
Stadionimiz chiroyli bo‘ldi.

6
00:00:13,737 --> 00:00:15,853
Lekin hali ko‘plab joylar bo‘sh!

7
00:00:15,923 --> 00:00:19,868
Har bir yangi obunachi — tribunamizda yana bitta virtual muxlis!

8
00:00:20,098 --> 00:00:23,235
Star Boys bilan o‘yinga qadar stadionimizni to‘ldiraylik!

9
00:00:23,305 --> 00:00:27,606
Biz maydonda kurashamiz, siz esa tribunada bizni qo‘llab-quvvatlang!

10
00:00:27,836 --> 00:00:30,617
Zamin FK’ni kuzating va obuna bo‘ling!

11
00:00:30,687 --> 00:00:32,162
Do‘stlaringizni ham chaqiring!

12
00:00:32,232 --> 00:00:36,034
Har bir obuna — stadionimizda yana bitta virtual muxlis!

13
00:00:36,104 --> 00:00:38,220
Star Boysga qarshi — birgamiz!

